; AEGIS actuator qualification entrypoint
; Disposable experiment only. Production AEGIS-BYZ.per does not load these files.
;
; Load order is intentional:
;   1. Complete AEGIS architecture
;   2. Native train actuator candidate
;   3. Action-specific verification candidate
;
; This entrypoint exists to isolate the first real command boundary without
; contaminating the production package.

(load "AEGIS-BYZ")
(load "AegisProm\\Aegis-actuator-train-candidate")
(load "AegisProm\\Aegis-verification-train-candidate")

; No other command is authorized by this experiment.
